sequenceDiagram
  participant Job as BullMQ Job
  participant Api as NestJS API
  participant NFZ as NFZ API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Alert as Alert Detector
  participant Mail as Email Provider

  Job->>Api: Load active subscription
  Api->>NFZ: Fetch current queue data
  NFZ-->>Api: Return public queue state
  Api->>DB: Store queue snapshot
  Api->>Alert: Compare with previous snapshot
  Alert->>DB: Create alert event if improved
  Alert->>Mail: Send notification email
  Mail-->>DB: Log email result

